    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n2683" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">annŏtātor</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">adn-</span></b> ), ōris,
			m.
		annoto. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>An observer</i>, <i>remarker</i>
			(post-Aug.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Non ante medium diem distentus
					solitariā cenā spectator adnotatorque
					convivis tuis immines,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					Pan. 49</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b> In
			the jurists, <i>the controller of the annual
			income</i>, Cod. Th. 12, 6, 3.</div>
